{"sections":[{"slug":"Atiyah--Singer族指标定理","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Atiyah--Singer族指标定理"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Atiyah–Singer <span lang=\"zh\">族指标定理</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Atiyah–Singer 族指标定理”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X\\to B$ <span lang=\"zh\">是紧合淹没</span> (proper submersion), <span lang=\"zh\">此时</span> Atiyah–Singer <span lang=\"zh\">族指标定理</span> (family index theorem)</p>\n"}}}]}